trait-luam-chrome-intolerance-name = Chrome Intolerance
trait-luam-chrome-intolerance-desc = Your body and mind reject cyberware. Your humanity is always 0 and neural chips do not raise it: any implant risks cyberpsychosis.
trait-luam-chrome-loyalty-name = Chrome Loyalty
trait-luam-chrome-loyalty-desc = You get along with cyberware easily. Your humanity is raised by 2.
